                "text": "It was great to see and speak to so many at the annual @amforest_org meeting this morning. As Chairman of the Water, Wildlife, and Fisheries Subcommittee, I will continue to advocate for policies that ensure improving the health of our forests and watersheds. https://t.co/jZiu6CtBUh",
