                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "With recent fires in Oregon\u2019s Second Congressional District, our forests can't be neglected due to failures of our forest management policies. \n\nThat is why I support the Fix Our Forest Act as it will ensure the health of our forests, increase resilience to catastrophic wildfires and help protect our communities.",
