                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am honored to have been appointed to the @HouseCommerce for the 119th Congress, chaired by @RepGuthrie. \n\nMy subcommittees are: \n-Energy\n-Health\n-Commerce, Manufacturing and Trade\n\nI look forward to serving on this important Committee.",
