                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I spoke with Travis Joseph from the American Forest Resource Council (AFRC). I appreciated the discussion of the importance of the Conservation and Landscape Health Rule, O&C lands, and other priorities that are important to Oregon communities. \n\nThank you for taking the time to meet with me in Washington!",
