                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My staff is here to help! My office recently helped Mr. Steven\u2019s in securing his Medicare payments after he could not access his Medicare due to the Change Health cyberattack. \n\nIf you need assistance with a federal agency, call us at (541) 776-4646 or visit my website here \u27a1\ufe0f https://t.co/RKqyuz43fe",
