                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today in the @HouseCommerce Health Subcommittee hearing, \u201cMade in America: Strengthening Domestic Manufacturing and Our Health Care Supply Chain\u201d, on which I serve, I raised concerns about our growing reliance on China for critical materials and the broader impact this has on our healthcare system. \n\nWe must strike a balance between building a stronger domestic supply chain as it is essential to keeping healthcare safe and affordable for all Americans.",
