                "text": "Today, I had an excellent meeting with the doctors and staff at the Deschutes Rim Health Clinic in Maupin. Their work is essential to ensuring families across south Wasco County have access to quality health care. Thank you for your invaluable service to the community! https://t.co/c5qlil75CE",
