                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Great news for Union County!\u00a0I was glad to support the Grande Ronde Hospital\u2019s grant (see attached letter). Today, I am pleased to share that Grande Ronde Hospital has received the $2.2 million dollars from the EDA to renovate its Acute and Behavioral Health Care Workforce Development Center in La Grande, Oregon. This project will expand and modernize a medical office building. Once completed, it is expected to create 156 new jobs while also saving 121 existing jobs. \n\nThank you to the EDA for their continued support of rural communities!",
                "text_lang": "en",
