                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you to the leadership at Siskiyou Community Health for meeting with me today. It was great to discuss the recent passage of the Working Family Tax Cuts (OBBB), the importance of Medicaid, and the need to make healthcare accessible in rural communities. \n\nAlso, it was great to learn more about your facilities and the work you all are doing to support the health of our community.",
