                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I have heard from parents, teachers, and mental health professionals who are all asking the same question: what exactly do social media platforms know about our children, and how are they using that information?\n\nMy bill, The Safe Social Media Act, which passed out of @HouseCommerce Subcommittee on CMT, takes an important first step by requiring a full, transparent accounting of these practices. Only with accurate data can we advance targeted policies that protect children online while encouraging innovation.",
